308
00:12:31,585 --> 00:12:34,444
Wikipedia says DeLorean Motor Company,

309
00:12:34,444 --> 00:12:37,378
founded by Stephen Wynne on the twelfth

310
00:12:37,378 --> 00:12:39,484
