312
00:12:43,697 --> 00:12:47,609
sells new-old-stock, original and aftermarket parts,

313
00:12:47,609 --> 00:12:50,091
plus maintenance and restoration.

314
00:12:50,271 --> 00:12:52,570
It has no direct connection with the

315
00:12:52,570 --> 00:12:53,464
