340
00:13:53,865 --> 00:13:55,661
First, total production:

341
00:13:55,661 --> 00:13:59,926
Wikipedia's introduction says an estimated nine thousand,

342
00:13:59,926 --> 00:14:02,995
while the model-year figures add to eight

343
00:14:02,995 --> 00:14:05,614
thousand nine hundred seventy-five.

344
00:14:05,794 --> 00:14:07,167
By our arithmetic,

345
00:14:07,167 --> 00:14:09,837
the difference is twenty-five cars,

346
00:14:09,837 --> 00:14:12,277
or less than three tenths of one

347
00:14:12,277 --> 00:14:12,888
percent.

348
00:14:13,068 --> 00:14:14,351
That is rounding,

349
00:14:14,351 --> 00:14:15,482
