350
00:14:15,832 --> 00:14:18,340
Second, built versus sold.

351
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:22,033
Wikipedia gives about seventy-five hundred built by

352
00:14:22,033 --> 00:14:24,168
the end of nineteen eighty-one,

353
00:14:24,168 --> 00:14:27,130
but its model-year table gives six thousand

354
00:14:27,130 --> 00:14:29,747
seven hundred for nineteen eighty-one.

355
00:14:29,927 --> 00:14:32,488
The two figures count different things,

356
00:14:32,488 --> 00:14:35,114
