357
00:14:35,114 --> 00:14:37,741
against cars assigned to the model year.

358
00:14:37,921 --> 00:14:39,949
The page does not explain,

359
00:14:39,949 --> 00:14:41,276
so neither do we.

360
00:14:41,625 --> 00:14:44,342
Third, when production ended.

361
00:14:44,522 --> 00:14:47,871
Wikipedia says factory production stopped in May

362
00:14:47,871 --> 00:14:51,430
nineteen eighty-two, yet it gives the twenty-fourth

363
00:14:51,430 --> 00:14:54,291
