365
00:14:58,866 --> 00:15:02,071
John DeLorean's page says by February nineteen

366
00:15:02,071 --> 00:15:04,857
eighty-two more than half of about seven

367
00:15:04,857 --> 00:15:07,295
thousand cars produced were unsold.

368
00:15:07,645 --> 00:15:09,689
Fourth, the gold cars.

369
00:15:09,869 --> 00:15:13,752
Wikipedia lists five vehicle numbers for gold-plated

370
00:15:13,752 --> 00:15:16,740
cars, but says only two American Express

371
00:15:16,740 --> 00:15:17,860
cars were sold,

372
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:20,400
and that three cars were plated in

373
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:22,117
twenty-four karat gold.

374
00:15:22,297 --> 00:15:23,776
By our arithmetic,

375
00:15:23,776 --> 00:15:26,732
five numbers against three cars is a

376
00:15:26,732 --> 00:15:28,950
mismatch we cannot resolve.

377
00:15:29,130 --> 00:15:31,225
It may be that other cars were

378
00:15:31,225 --> 00:15:33,669
