379
00:15:33,669 --> 00:15:33,948
say.

380
00:15:34,297 --> 00:15:35,656
Fifth, power.

381
00:15:35,836 --> 00:15:37,886
The US car is listed at one

382
00:15:37,886 --> 00:15:39,860
hundred thirty horsepower,

383
00:15:39,860 --> 00:15:42,593
while a few European cars are listed

384
00:15:42,593 --> 00:15:44,567
at one hundred fifty-four.

385
00:15:44,747 --> 00:15:46,018
By our arithmetic,

386
00:15:46,018 --> 00:15:48,137
that is nineteen percent more.

387
00:15:48,317 --> 00:15:51,741
Wikipedia explains the lower number as a

388
00:15:51,741 --> 00:15:53,367
