389
00:15:53,547 --> 00:15:55,260
It does not say why a few

390
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:57,796
European cars kept the higher rating.

391
00:15:58,146 --> 00:16:01,641
A smaller story is the right-hand-drive cars.

392
00:16:01,821 --> 00:16:04,824
Wikipedia says about thirty early cars were

393
00:16:04,824 --> 00:16:06,291
