00:16:22,985 --> 00:16:25,554
mostly built for the left side of

400
00:16:25,554 --> 00:16:26,254
the road.

401
00:16:26,604 --> 00:16:27,847
By our arithmetic,

402
00:16:27,847 --> 00:16:30,816
thirteen conversions are about a seventh of

403
00:16:30,816 --> 00:16:33,439
one percent of the eight thousand nine

404
00:16:33,439 --> 00:16:35,649
hundred seventy-five cars built.

405
00:16:35,829 --> 00:16:39,850
Eight post-factory conversions are another nine hundredths

406
00:16:39,850 --> 00:16:40,751
of a percent.

