418
00:17:08,524 --> 00:17:10,521
For the first two prototypes,

419
00:17:10,521 --> 00:17:13,000
the sources give a different kind of

420
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,584
record: auction prices.

421
00:17:14,934 --> 00:17:17,659
Wikipedia says Prototype One sold at the

